  "scope": "129 valid, distinct official SanGIS unstacked reference polygons audited in thirteen bounded local cells near the WUP 2025 San Diego settlement locator. All required real-adapter checks passed across recorded attempts with explicit provider-timeout retries. No sampled overlaps above 0.01 m\u00b2, duplicate geometry or invalid polygons were found. This is bounded San Diego-area source verification, not municipality-wide completeness or legal survey evidence. SanGIS uses one reference polygon per tax parcel; selected APNs may change, so runtime identity uses native PARCELID rather than APN.",
